1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Do you think people will return to Kfar Aza?

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,633
It will take time.

3
00:00:08,633 --> 00:00:10,800
I don't know how many will be back.

4
00:00:11,366 --> 00:00:13,133
Not all of them will be back.

5
00:00:14,966 --> 00:00:18,500
I think that my daughter will not be back,

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,666
and I have nothing to tell her,

7
00:00:20,666 --> 00:00:24,000
and I will not try to to convince her.

8
00:00:25,766 --> 00:00:28,000
because it's not...

9
00:00:31,133 --> 00:00:32,033
I can not.

10
00:00:32,333 --> 00:00:34,166
I can not tell her:

11
00:00:34,166 --> 00:00:38,666
"I want you to live with me here in Kfar Aza".

12
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,900
Because she's afraid.

13
00:00:42,833 --> 00:00:45,633
She hasn't been here since the October 7th.

14
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,900
Since the day when when we were together,

15
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,133
when went out,

16
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:53,466
she wasn't in her own house.

17
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:56,233
a child, the little one, Rif,

18
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,500
he doesn't know his house,

19
00:01:00,166 --> 00:01:01,800
he has never been there.

20
00:01:03,033 --> 00:01:06,333
So, most of the people, I believe, will come back.

21
00:01:06,333 --> 00:01:09,433
It will take time, but most of them will be back.

22
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:15,033
But a big part of us will not be back.

